  <p>Настоящата Политика за бисквитки може да бъде актуализирана по всяко време, особено при въвеждане на нови бисквитки. Актуализираната версия винаги ще е налична на тази страница.</p>

  <h2>6. Контакти</h2>
  <p>За всякакви въпроси относно използването на бисквитки, моля пишете на <a href="mailto:info@eternaltouch.it">info@eternaltouch.it</a>.</p>

  <% } else { %>

  <p>This Cookie Policy describes the types of cookies used on the website <a href="https://eternaltouch.it">eternaltouch.it</a>, the purposes and how to manage consent, in compliance with Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR), Directive 2002/58/EC ("ePrivacy") and the guidelines of the relevant supervisory authorities.</p>

  <h2>1. What cookies are</h2>
  <p>Cookies are small text files that visited websites send to the user's terminal, where they are stored to be retransmitted to the same sites on subsequent visits. They can be installed by the site itself (first-party cookies) or by different sites (third-party cookies).</p>

  <h2>2. Categories of cookies we use</h2>

  <h3>2.1 Technical (necessary) cookies — always active</h3>
  <p>These are essential for the site to function and do not require user consent under the ePrivacy exemption.</p>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Cookie</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th><th>Type</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>lang</code></td><td>Stores the user's chosen language</td><td>1 year</td><td>First-party</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>et_consent</code></td><td>Stores cookie consent preferences</td><td>1 year</td><td>First-party</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>adminToken</code></td><td>Authentication session (administrators only)</td><td>7 days</td><td>First-party</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3>2.2 Analytics cookies — consent required</h3>
  <p>Currently <strong>no third-party analytics cookies are installed</strong>. Should they be activated in future (e.g. Google Analytics, Plausible, Matomo), users will be notified in advance and installation will only take place after explicit consent.</p>

  <h3>2.3 Marketing cookies — consent required</h3>
  <p>Currently <strong>no marketing or profiling cookies are installed</strong>. Should they be activated in future (e.g. Meta Pixel, Google Ads), users will be notified in advance and installation will only take place after explicit consent.</p>

  <h3>2.4 Typographic fonts — self-hosted</h3>
  <p>Typographic fonts are hosted directly on our own server (self-hosting). The site does <strong>not</strong> request Google Fonts or any other third-party server to load fonts: no third-party cookies are installed and no IP address is transmitted to external providers for this purpose.</p>

  <h2>3. Consent management</h2>
  <p>On first access to the site, an informational banner is displayed allowing the user to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Accept all</strong> cookies;</li>
    <li><strong>Reject</strong> all non-necessary cookies;</li>
    <li><strong>Customise</strong> their choices by enabling or disabling each category of non-necessary cookies.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The consent given is stored for one year and can be modified or withdrawn at any time using the following button:</p>
  <p><button type="button" class="reopen-cookies" data-reopen-cookies>Manage cookie preferences</button></p>

  <h2>4. Disabling cookies via your browser</h2>
  <p>The user can also manage preferences directly from their browser:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Chrome</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://support.mozilla.org/kb/clear-cookies-and-site-data-firefox" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mozilla Firefox</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://support.apple.com/guide/safari/manage-cookies-sfri11471/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Safari</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://support.microsoft.com/help/4027947" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Microsoft Edge</a></li>
  </ul>
  <p>Disabling technical cookies may impair some sections of the site.</p>

  <h2>5. Updates</h2>
  <p>This Cookie Policy may be updated at any time, in particular if new cookies are introduced. The updated version will always be available on this page.</p>

  <h2>6. Contact</h2>
